<div class="wrap prose">
  <h1>Pricing</h1>
  <p>{{ brand.name }} is free for cleaning and saving single pages, as often as you like, and for packs of up to 3 pages. {{ brand.proName }} is a single payment of <strong>{{ brand.priceLabel }}</strong>. There is no subscription and updates are included.</p>
  {% include "plans-table.njk" %}
  <div class="price-card">
    <p class="price">{{ brand.priceLabel }}</p>
    {% include "buy-button.njk" %}
  </div>
  <h2>How buying works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Lemon Squeezy is the seller (merchant of record): it takes the payment, charges any sales tax or VAT that applies in your country, and sends your receipt. The store's name at checkout and on your card statement is {{ brand.seller.storeName }}. Prices shown at checkout include tax where it applies.</li>
    <li>You receive a licence key on the receipt page and by email. Paste it into the extension (Options → Licence) to switch on Pro.</li>
    <li>One key gives you {{ brand.activationLimit }} activations, and each browser counts as one (Chrome and Edge on the same computer use two). Deactivate (Options → Licence) frees one.</li>
    <li>If it isn't right for you, you can get a full refund within {{ brand.refundDays }} days — see the <a href="/legal/refunds/">refund policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</div>
